找长生仙药，三年后，李不凡带着长生仙药归来，上供给皇帝。皇帝昏庸残暴，生性多疑，并不相信这是真的长生仙药，听信奸臣谗言，认为李不凡是要毒害自己。不仅逼迫李不凡吃下仙药，还残害李不凡的家人。最终，李不凡依靠仙药飞升成仙，皇帝因为自己多疑性格，最终自食恶果，众叛亲离，生命走到尽头。","series_id":"7531271450813008921","episode":true,"vertical":true,"content_type":1,"recommend_info":"{\"channel_id\":\"94349560332\",\"request_id\":\"2026110623311480FFD1D70B1EA79D2EF1\",\"rank\":\"2\",\"queue_names\":\"shortplay\",\"final_queue_name\":\"heji\",\"gid\":\"7531271450813008921\",\"plan_id\":\"1\",\"is_show_ad_flag\":\"0\",\"series_pred_score\":\"{\\\"absolute_staytime\\\":0.1194329634308815,\\\"collect\\\":0.03461884334683418,\\\"stream_ctr\\\":0.06236610189080238,\\\"like\\\":0.05500529333949089,\\\"staytime_stream\\\":1.0814334154129028,\\\"finish\\\":0.002472623949870467,\\\"normalized_duration\\\":0.7022150158882141}\"}","recommend_group_id":"7531271450813008921","play_cnt":83565,"book_exist":false,"copyright":"树下的椰子","sub_title":"玄幻·玄幻仙侠","score":"8.2","use_video_model":true,"episode_cnt":64,"video_platform":3,"disable_play":false,"category_schema":"[{\"category_id\":5008,\"name\":\"玄幻\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5008&categoryName=玄幻&genreType=130&gender=1&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5072,\"name\":\"玄幻仙侠\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5072&categoryName=玄幻仙侠&genreType=130&gender=1&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5178,\"name\":\"逆风翻盘\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5178&categoryName=逆风翻盘&genreType=130&gender=1&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5224,\"name\":\"大男主\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5224&categoryName=大男主&genreType=130&gender=1&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5226,\"name\":\"忠诚男主\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5226&categoryName=忠诚男主&genreType=130&gender=1&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5339,\"name\":\"古代\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5339&categoryName=古代&genreType=130&gender=1&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5357,\"name\":\"修仙问道\",\"schema\":\"drago